description "Wolf game streaming server: Steam in Gamepad UI, streamed to Moonlight clients over the network"

supports "fedora"

// The container needs the host driver exposed through a CDI spec, which
// the toolkit module generates at boot from /sys. Depend on the
// capability so the spec exists before this ever runs.
requires "nvidia-driver"

// A pure-file module: the quadlet below is the whole deliverable. Wolf
// itself and its per-game app containers come from images pulled at
// runtime, so nothing is installed into the image tree.
